{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人吳若希拍攝《三代同糖》引爆各界聲音。</p><p>早前，她被指飛出《三代同糖》，更被爆因捱得太辛苦，曾在拍攝期間暈倒兼送院。</p><p>而日前在兒子的生日會上，她又被拍到手震兼面青口唇白。</p><p>對此，吳若希受訪時否認曾在拍攝期間暈倒，但承認的確有手震：「呢個問題就真係</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T14:01:46.899401+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T13:38:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T13:54:57.400045+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T13:54:57.400045+00:00","content_hash":"bad7ae793192ac3ea3458da75400b1f07c9a5a6b165428748c4e3288e46ef030","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}